    "PyYAML 版本低于 5.4",
    "yaml.load 使用 FullLoader（默认或显式）",
    "YAML 文档包含 !!python/object/new 构造器标签"
  ],
  "exploit_evidence": [
    {
      "src": 0,
      "kind": "poc",
      "quote": "RCE in PyYAML before 5.4 via !!python/object/new tags with FullLoader."
    },
    {
      "src": 1,
      "kind": "poc",
      "quote": "EIP currently links 5 repository PoCs, 6 curated repository PoCs, and 2 lab environments to CVE-2020-14343."
    }
  ],
  "fixed_version": "5.4",
  "summary_zh": "PyYAML 5.3 的 FullLoader 解析不可信 YAML 可致 RCE，请升级 5.4 或改用 safe_load。"
}
